          "ID": "AZU-0011",
          "Title": "The minimum TLS version for Storage Accounts should be TLS1_2 or higher",
          "Description": "Azure Storage supports four versions of the TLS protocol: 1.0, 1.1, 1.2, and 1.3.\nAzure Storage uses TLS 1.2 or TLS 1.3 on public HTTPS endpoints, while TLS 1.0 and TLS 1.1 are still supported for backward compatibility.\nThis check will warn if the minimum TLS version is set lower than TLS1_2. TLS1_2 and TLS1_3 are both allowed.\n",
